      "dc:description": {
        "de": [
          "Morgens am Strand und auf der Esplanade Parmentier.\nOrganisiert von Berck Opale Sud Triathlon.\nInfos folgen auf https://www.facebook.com/Berckbikeandrun\n Anmeldung auf https://berck-bike-and-run.adeorun.com/"
        ],
        "en": [
          "Morning on the beach and on the esplanade Parmentier.\nOrganized by Berck Opale Sud Triathlon.\nMore information on https://www.facebook.com/Berckbikeandrun\n Registration on https://berck-bike-and-run.adeorun.com/"
        ],
        "it": [
          "Al mattino sulla spiaggia e sulla spianata Parmentier.\nOrganizzato da Berck Opale Sud Triathlon.\nDettagli su https://www.facebook.com/Berckbikeandrun\n Iscrizioni su https://berck-bike-and-run.adeorun.com/"
        ],
        "fr": [
          "Le matin sur la plage et sur l’esplanade Parmentier. \nOrganisé par Berck Opale Sud Triathlon. \nInfos à venir sur https://www.facebook.com/Berckbikeandrun\n Inscription sur https://berck-bike-and-run.adeorun.com/"
        ],
        "nl": [
          "S Ochtends op het strand en op de esplanade Parmentier.\nGeorganiseerd door Berck Opale Sud Triathlon.\nDetails volgen op https://www.facebook.com/Berckbikeandrun\n Inschrijving op https://berck-bike-and-run.adeorun.com/"
        ],
        "es": [
          "Por la mañana en la playa y en la explanada Parmentier.\nOrganizado por Berck Opale Sud Triathlon.\nDetalles a seguir en https://www.facebook.com/Berckbikeandrun\n Inscripciones en https://berck-bike-and-run.adeorun.com/"
        ]
